              "y1": 702.3233032226562
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/6515",
            "canonical_text": "If you configured the Automatic table zeroing and manually set the table position to zero in the tools area after automated zeroing has been performed, the manual set zero overwrites the automated set zero.",
